    <bpmn:process id="W_W4179" name="W4179. Security Guarding Service Coordination &amp; Site Protection" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Contract cycle; site opening (VS-37); security-incident response
Frequency: 24/7 service + periodic review
Volume: ~205 sites × guarding posts (entrance, patrol, after-hours)
Owner: Facilities Security Coordinator / Loss Prevention (VS-23)
Participants: Guarding Provider (VS-98), LP (VS-23.2), Store Ops (VS-07), Cash-in-Transit (VS-81)
Source: workflow W4179 — Security Guarding Service Coordination &amp; Site Protection</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4179_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4179_Lane1" name="Facilities Security Coord">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4179_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4179_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4179_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4179_Lane2" name="Guard">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4179_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4179_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4179_Start4" name="Contract cycle; site opening (VS-37); security-incident response">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4179_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4179_Task5" name="Facilities/LP coordinate the guarding-service contract (post-manning, shifts…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Facilities/LP coordinate the guarding-service contract (post-manning, shifts, arming/batons per policy, licensing/SOB/SSS compliance) resourced by the provider (VS-98), distinct from LP surveillance (VS-23.2)
Responsible (R): Facilities Security Coord / LP / Provider
Accountable (A): Head of Facilities / LP Director
Duration: Per contract</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4179_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4179_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4179_Task6" name="Guards execute posts (entrance control, patrol, after-hours watch, cash-pickup…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Guards execute posts (entrance control, patrol, after-hours watch, cash-pickup coordination links to VS-81), reporting incidents to LP/helpdesk (VS-23.1/W4174)
Responsible (R): Guard / Provider
Accountable (A): Facilities Security Coord
Duration: 24/7</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4179_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4179_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4179_Task7" name="Facilities/LP manage guard performance (attendance, incident response)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Facilities/LP manage guard performance (attendance, incident response), licensing/compliance, and coordinate with LP investigations (VS-23.1) and emergency response (VS-24.2)
Responsible (R): Facilities Security Coord / LP / Provider
Accountable (A): Head of Facilities / LP Director
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4179_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4179_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4179_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4179_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4179_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-645 (ensure controlled execution — Hard &amp; Soft FM Service Operations (Cleaning, Pest, Security, Grounds, Workplace) (PA-138.2).) | - CTL-645: guards licensed/compliance-checked; guarding-vs-LP RACI documented (VS-23); incident reporting
Owner: Facilities Security Coordinator / Loss Prevention (VS-23)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4179_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4179_Annotation9" targetRef="W4179_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
