    <bpmn:process id="W_W4180" name="W4180. Grounds, Landscaping &amp; Exterior Maintenance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Scheduled cycle; storm damage; exterior defect report
Frequency: Periodic (weekly/monthly) + reactive
Volume: ~205 sites × exterior/grounds (parking, yard, signage, facade, perimeter)
Owner: Facilities Soft/Hard-Services Lead / Grounds Provider
Participants: Site staff (VS-07), Provider, Engineering (VS-20.2), Real Estate (VS-97)
Source: workflow W4180 — Grounds, Landscaping &amp; Exterior Maintenance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4180_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4180_Lane1" name="Provider">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4180_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4180_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4180_Lane2" name="Facilities Maintenance Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4180_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4180_Lane3" name="Facilities Soft-Services Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4180_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4180_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4180_Start5" name="Scheduled cycle; storm damage; exterior defect report">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4180_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4180_Task6" name="Facilities/Provider maintain grounds and exterior — parking-lot…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Facilities/Provider maintain grounds and exterior — parking-lot sweeping/line-marking, landscaping/trimming, drainage clearing, signage/facade condition — per site standard
Responsible (R): Provider / Facilities Soft-Services Lead
Accountable (A): Facilities Soft-Services Lead
