    <bpmn:process id="W_W4184" name="W4184. Hard FM Trades — HVAC, Electrical, Plumbing &amp; Fire Systems Service" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: PM schedule (W4173); reactive fault (W4174); compliance test
Frequency: Continuous (PM + reactive)
Volume: ~205 sites × building systems (HVAC, electrical, plumbing, fire, elevators, generators)
Owner: Facilities Maintenance Lead / Trades Contractors
Participants: Trades contractors, Engineering (VS-20.2), HSE (VS-24), Store Ops (VS-07)
Source: workflow W4184 — Hard FM Trades — HVAC, Electrical, Plumbing &amp; Fire Systems Service</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4184_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4184_Lane1" name="Trades Contractor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4184_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4184_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4184_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4184_Lane2" name="Facilities Maintenance Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4184_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4184_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4184_Start4" name="PM schedule (W4173); reactive fault (W4174); compliance test">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4184_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4184_Task5" name="Trades execute PM on building systems (HVAC service, electrical inspection…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Trades execute PM on building systems (HVAC service, electrical inspection, plumbing, fire-system test, generator load-test, elevator service — W4173), documenting completion/findings
Responsible (R): Trades Contractor / Facilities Maintenance Lead
Accountable (A): Facilities Maintenance Lead
Duration: Per schedule</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4184_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4184_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4184_Task6" name="Trades respond to reactive faults via work-orders (W4174) — AC failure, power…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Trades respond to reactive faults via work-orders (W4174) — AC failure, power, leak, elevator trap — within SLA, coordinating with site operations and emergency response (VS-24.2)
Responsible (R): Trades Contractor / Facilities Maintenance Lead
Accountable (A): Facilities Maintenance Lead
Duration: Reactive</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4184_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4184_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4184_Task7" name="Facilities manage trades-contractor competence/licensing (electrical…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Facilities manage trades-contractor competence/licensing (electrical, fire-system, elevator cert), compliance, and feed major findings into capex/condition (W4172/VS-40)
Responsible (R): Facilities Maintenance Lead / Engineering
Accountable (A): Head of Facilities
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4184_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4184_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4184_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4184_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4184_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-645 (ensure controlled execution — Hard &amp; Soft FM Service Operations (Cleaning, Pest, Security, Grounds, Workplace) (PA-138.2).) | - CTL-645 (trades licensed/certified (electrical/fire/elevator); PM completion + compliance tracked (VS-24/VS-22))
Owner: Facilities Maintenance Lead / Trades Contractors</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
